<header class=3D"hero">
  <div class=3D"wrap">
    <p class=3D"eyebrow">Architecture Overview</p>
    <h1>Selenium&nbsp;+ TestNG&nbsp;Framework</h1>
    <p class=3D"dek">A parallel-safe UI automation framework for <strong>sa=
ucedemo.com</strong>. Tests talk only to <strong>services</strong>; service=
s drive <strong>page objects and reusable page modules</strong> and hand wh=
at they read to <strong>assertions</strong>. Driver sessions are per-thread=
 and permit-capped, and every run feeds cross-run flaky detection and test-=
impact analysis.</p>
    <div class=3D"stack-chips">
      <span class=3D"chip">Java 17</span>
      <span class=3D"chip">Selenium 4.33</span>
      <span class=3D"chip">TestNG 7.10</span>
      <span class=3D"chip">Maven Surefire</span>
      <span class=3D"chip">Selenium Manager</span>
      <span class=3D"chip">Page Objects + Modules</span>
      <span class=3D"chip">Jackson</span>
      <span class=3D"chip">picocli</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

