<section>
  <div class=3D"wrap">
    <div class=3D"section-head"><span class=3D"section-num">02</span><h2>Pa=
ge objects &amp; reusable page modules</h2></div>
    <p class=3D"section-intro">A <strong>page object</strong> models one sc=
reen. A <strong>page module</strong> models a UI fragment that appears on s=
everal screens: the header with the cart badge and link, the burger menu, a=
nd the form-error banner. Each fragment's locators then live in exactly one=
 class. Every page reachable after login implements <code>LoggedInPage</cod=
e>, which exposes <code>header()</code>.</p>
    <figure>
      <svg viewBox=3D"0 0 960 300" role=3D"img" aria-label=3D"LoggedInPage =
exposes header() returning HeaderModule, which opens BurgerMenuModule; Inve=
ntoryPage, CartPage and checkout pages implement LoggedInPage; LoginPage an=
d CheckoutStepOnePage expose errorMessage() returning ErrorMessageModule.">
