    <div class=3D"section-head"><span class=3D"section-num">03</span><h2>Pa=
rallel execution &amp; browser sessions</h2></div>
    <p class=3D"section-intro">The suite runs <code>parallel=3D"classes"</c=
ode> with <code>thread-count=3D"10"</code>. Each thread owns a <code>Thread=
Local</code> map of session id =E2=86=92 <code>WebDriver</code>, so a test =
can open several browsers (<code>BROWSER_SESSION.FIRST/SECOND/THIRD</code>)=
 and switch between them. A global semaphore caps how many real browsers ex=
ist at once.</p>
